{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P你好，陌生人！你來這裡有何貴幹？我以前沒在這地方見過你。\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":0,"lines":0}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":28,"lines":1}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":1,"text":"1. 我只是在探索深淵。\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":1,"cells":12,"lines":0}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":2,"text":"2. 我正試著救出一名無辜的女孩。\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":2,"cells":29,"lines":1}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":3,"text":"3. 我被丟進這裡，為一樁並非我所犯的罪受罰。\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":3,"cells":52,"lines":2}
{"event":"selection","box":0,"value":1,"cells":52,"lines":2}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\1我只是在探索深淵。\\0\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":37,"lines":2}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P探索，是嗎？哈，這藉口真不錯。不過，你要是不願說自己犯了什麼罪，我也無意過問。\\m\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":37,"lines":3}
{"event":"more","box":1,"value":0,"cells":57,"lines":4}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":51,"lines":4}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\PThou needst not be ashamed of thy misfortune, lad; thou art in the same pot with all of us now.  If thou art to have a chance of surviving in the Abyss for long, thou must learn the lay of the land.\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":51,"lines":5}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":246,"lines":8}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":1,"text":"1. 的確，我很想多了解這一帶。\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":1,"cells":16,"lines":0}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":2,"text":"2. 我自己應付得來。\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":2,"cells":27,"lines":1}
{"event":"selection","box":0,"value":1,"cells":27,"lines":1}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\1的確，我很想多了解這一帶。\\0\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":256,"lines":9}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P首先，我勸你把找到的有用東西都撿起來。這裡的物資十分稀少，能拿多少就拿多少。\u000a 你儘管搜集散落的東西，但最好別偷竊。深淵裡多數居民都會嚴加看守自己僅有的那點財物。\u000a 戰場是搜集物資的好地方。我就是為此而來。不久前，哥布林和地面上的人在這裡打了一仗。\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":247,"lines":10}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":221,"lines":15}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":1,"text":"1. 這裡住著哪些人？\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":1,"cells":11,"lines":0}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":2,"text":"2. 那場戰役是怎麼引起的？\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":2,"cells":25,"lines":1}
{"event":"selection","box":0,"value":2,"cells":25,"lines":1}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\1那場戰役是怎麼引起的？\\0\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":175,"lines":16}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P我不知道。男爵很少派人進入深淵，想必是有要事。不過，看樣子哥布林輕易就打敗了他們。\\m\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":144,"lines":17}
{"event":"more","box":1,"value":0,"cells":153,"lines":18}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":147,"lines":18}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P哥布林控制著上層洞穴的大部分地區。牠們分成兩族：綠哥布林與灰哥布林。兩族至今還沒消滅彼此，可不是因為不夠賣力。\u000a 你要特別小心灰哥布林。我前不久才因為闖入牠們的地盤而被關起來。\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":134,"lines":19}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":138,"lines":23}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":1,"text":"1. 那一定很可怕！\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":1,"cells":10,"lines":0}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":2,"text":"2. 你是怎麼逃出來的？\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":0,"value":2,"cells":22,"lines":1}
{"event":"selection","box":0,"value":2,"cells":22,"lines":1}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\1你是怎麼逃出來的？\\0\u000a"}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":136,"lines":24}
{"event":"text","box":1,"choice":0,"text":"\\P我的牢房顯然是儲藏室改建的，裡面還放著不少有用的東西，包括一根長竿。我用長竿碰到了開門的按鈕，偷偷溜走，回到自己人那裡。我想，我不會再去那地方冒險了。\u000a"}
{"event":"pause","box":1,"value":200,"cells":112,"lines":25}
{"event":"write","box":1,"value":0,"cells":170,"lines":27}
{"event":"text","box":0,"choice":1,"text":"1. 深淵裡還有哪些居民？\u000a"}
